<doc id="173828" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173828" title="Duduh iwak Bermuda">
Duduh iwak Bermuda

Chowder iwak Bermuda minangka &lt;a href="Sop"&gt;sup&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="chowder"&gt;chowder&lt;/a&gt; sing dianggep minangka panganan nasional &lt;a href="Bermuda"&gt;Bermuda&lt;/a&gt;. Bahan-bahan utamane yaiku &lt;a href="Iwak%20%28panganan%29"&gt;iwak&lt;/a&gt;, tomat lan bawang, dibumbui karo &lt;a href="Rum%20%28unjukan%20mawi%20alkohol%29"&gt;rum ireng&lt;/a&gt; lan "saos mrico sherry". Resep kasebut dipercaya dikembangake dening &lt;a href="Bermuda"&gt;penjajah Inggris Bermuda ing abad kaping 17&lt;/a&gt;. Ing bahan dhasar saka Bermuda iwak Chowder sing &lt;a href="Iwak%20%28panganan%29"&gt;iwak&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kaldhu"&gt;simpenan&lt;/a&gt;, iwak fillets, lan tomat puree. Bahan-bahan liyane biasane sayuran lan jamu lan rempah-rempah.
Ana macem-macem variasi saka bahan dhasar kasebut. Siji resep nggunakake sak cangkir bawang, &lt;a href="Sl%C3%A8dri"&gt;celery&lt;/a&gt;, lan wortel sing disigar lan uga daging babi sing dicincang lan &lt;a href="K%C3%A9cap%20inggris"&gt;saus Worcestershire&lt;/a&gt;. Liyane nggunakake isi iwak putih (iwak kod, kerapu, iwak ubin, utawa kakap), bawang, wortel, celery, bawang putih cincang, mentega tanpa garam, &lt;a href="godhong%20teluk"&gt;godhong teluk&lt;/a&gt;, thyme, allspice, saus Worcestershire, rum ireng lan saos mrico sherry. Jinis iwak liyane bisa digunakake kaya iwak karang utawa iwak laut. Konsistensi chowder iwak Bermuda luwih entheng tinimbang &lt;a href="chowder"&gt;chowder&lt;/a&gt; sing &lt;a href="Agen%20kenthel"&gt;kandel&lt;/a&gt; karo susu utawa krim. Kadhangkala dibandhingake karo &lt;a href="bouillabaisse"&gt;bouillabaisse&lt;/a&gt;. 
