<doc id="173838" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173838" title="Pai krim">
Pai krim

Pie krim minangka salah sawijining olahan jinis pie sing diisi karo &lt;a href="Custard"&gt;wadi&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Pudhing"&gt;puding&lt;/a&gt; sing digawe saka susu, &lt;a href="Krim%20%28omb%C3%A8nan%29"&gt;krim&lt;/a&gt;, gula, glepung gandum, lan &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;. Kasedhiya ing macem-macem jinis, kalebu &lt;a href="Vanila"&gt;vanilla&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;lemon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jeruk%20limau"&gt;jeruk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sel%C3%A9%20kacang"&gt;butter kacang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gedhang"&gt;banana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Krambil"&gt;klapa&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Soklat"&gt;coklat&lt;/a&gt;. Salah sawijining fitur sing paling apik yaiku krim &lt;a href="Krim%20kocok"&gt;krim&lt;/a&gt; topping. The custard Isi gegandhengan &lt;a href="Custard"&gt;patissière creme&lt;/a&gt;, komponèn tombol &lt;a href="Olah-olahan%20Prancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bolu"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tart"&gt;tarts&lt;/a&gt;. Iki minangka kue siji-kerak, tegese kulit nutupi ngisor lan sisih nanging dudu sisih ndhuwur. Kerak bisa uga kulit pai standar sing digawe nganggo &lt;a href="Kukis"&gt;cookie&lt;/a&gt; hancur utawa &lt;a href="Kerak%20kr%C3%A8k%C3%A8r%20graham"&gt;kerupuk krupuk graham&lt;/a&gt; kanggo pai sing gurih.
