<doc id="173858" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173858" title="Dal baati">
Dal baati

[&lt;a href="https%3A//en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABaati_being_cooked%2C_Pushkar_camel_fair.jpg%7Cjpg"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;]
Baati Dal iku sawijining &lt;a href="Olah-olahan%20India"&gt;panganan Indian&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Dal%20%28panganan%29"&gt;dal&lt;/a&gt; (lentils) lan &lt;a href="baati"&gt;baati&lt;/a&gt; (gandum hard nggulung). Iki misuwur ing &lt;a href="Rajasthan"&gt;Rajasthan&lt;/a&gt;, Maharashtra Khandesh lan wilayah Vidarbha, &lt;a href="Gujarat"&gt;Gujarat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Uttar%20Pradesh"&gt;Uttar Pradesh&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Madhya%20Pradesh"&gt;Madhya Pradesh&lt;/a&gt; (utamane ing wilayah &lt;a href="Braj"&gt;Braj&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nimar"&gt;Nimar&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Malwa"&gt;Malwa&lt;/a&gt;).
Dal bafla (#ALIH) minangka variasi dal baati, ing endi Bafla sing umume digodhog sadurunge dipanggang ing oven baati tradisional. Batti diganti bafla, versi sing luwih alus.
