<doc id="173861" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173861" title="Lei cha">
Lei cha

Lei cha (Chinese ; pocapan [lě i ʈʂʰa ̌]) utawa tèh minangka wedang utawa gruel sing &lt;a href="T%C3%A8h"&gt;didhasarake ing&lt;/a&gt; Tiongkok Kidul. Kebiasaan Lei cha diwiwiti ing jaman Tiga Kerajaan utawa uga &lt;a href="Wangsa%20Han"&gt;Dinasti Han&lt;/a&gt;. Umumé nyebar ing antarane &lt;a href="Wong%20Hakka"&gt;masarakat&lt;/a&gt; Hakka ing wilayah Hakka ing Taiwan. Iki digawa dening wong Hakka menyang &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Cina"&gt;Taiwan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, lan wilayah apa wae kanthi pedunung Hakka diaspora. Kajaba Hakka Lei cha, Lei cha uga tradisional banget ing antarane masarakat Hunan ing sisih Lor, Provinsi Hunan, Tiongkok Daratan. Dadi, kebiasaan Lei cha ing China duwe rong jinis: &lt;a href="Wong%20Hakka"&gt;Hakka&lt;/a&gt; Lei cha; lan Hunan Lei cha. Lei cha ora padha karo &lt;a href="Teh%20Taiwanese"&gt;teh Taiwan&lt;/a&gt; amarga mesthi ana bahan liyane. Tèh ing lemah kalebu campuran godhong tèh lan &lt;a href="Herba"&gt;rempah&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Herba"&gt;rempah&lt;/a&gt; sing digiling bebarengan karo macem-macem &lt;a href="Kacang%20%28woh%29"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt; panggang, &lt;a href="wiji"&gt;wiji&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gandum"&gt;biji-bijian&lt;/a&gt;, lan rasa.

</doc>
<doc id="173862" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173862" title="Blanquette de veau">
Blanquette de veau

Blanquette de veau (]) yaiku &lt;a href="Ragout"&gt;ras&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Daging%20sapi%20enom"&gt;veal&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Olah-olahan%20Prancis"&gt;Prancis sing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Daging%20sapi%20enom"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; sapi utawa mentega ora kecoklatan nalika masak. Kanggo nyegah daging coklat lan lemak kanthi cara iki, yaiku masak kanthi en blanquette.
&lt;a href="Kamakmuran%20Montagne"&gt;Prosper Montagne&lt;/a&gt; nulis manawa "Blanquette duwe papan sing penting banget ing masakan sejarah lan dadi klasik masakan &lt;a href="borjuis"&gt;borjuis&lt;/a&gt;. Blanquette uga digawe nganggo iwak (&lt;a href="monkfish"&gt;monkfish&lt;/a&gt;) lan sayuran (&lt;a href="chard"&gt;chard&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sl%C3%A8dri"&gt;celery&lt;/a&gt;.) "

</doc>
<doc id="173863" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173863" title="Filé bubuk">
Filé bubuk

Powder filé, uga diarani gumbo filé, minangka &lt;a href="Herba"&gt;ramuan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bumbon%20crak%C3%A8n"&gt;pedhes sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka godhong garing lan lemah wit sassafras Amerika Utara (Sassafras albidum). Wêdakakêna Filé digunakake ing &lt;a href="masakan%20Louisiana%20Creole"&gt;masakan Louisiana Creole&lt;/a&gt; nalika nggawe sawetara jinis &lt;a href="gumbo"&gt;gumbo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sop"&gt;sup&lt;/a&gt; Creole sing kenthel utawa &lt;a href="Godhogan"&gt;rebus&lt;/a&gt; asring disajikake &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;sega&lt;/a&gt;. Ana macem-macem macem-macem jinis sing ana. Ing New Orleans, sing diarani Creole gumbo umume beda-beda gumantung saka omah lan omah, sanajan isih duwe asal usul Native American. Cipta Kali Cane nggawe gumbo luwih fokus ing filé. Filé bisa nyedhiyakake kenthel nalika okra ora ana ing musim, ing jinis gumbo sing nggunakake &lt;a href="Bendi"&gt;okra&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="roux"&gt;roux&lt;/a&gt; minangka gandhel kanggo gumbo tinimbang filé. Nyemprotake kanthi sithik ing gumbo minangka &lt;a href="Pambumbuan"&gt;bumbu&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Agen%20kenthel"&gt;agen penebalan&lt;/a&gt;, bubuk filé nambah rasa lan tekstur khas sing khas.
