<doc id="173871" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173871" title="Schnitzel">
Schnitzel

Schnitzel minangka salah sawijining olahan jinis irisan &lt;a href="Daging"&gt;daging sing&lt;/a&gt; tipis (utawa alternatif vegetarian, kayata &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt;) sing digoreng nganggo lemak. Daging biasane diencerake kanthi dibungkus nganggo alat aduk daging. Umume, daging &lt;a href="Panir"&gt;diwenehi roti&lt;/a&gt; sadurunge digoreng. Schnitzel roti paling populer ing pirang-pirang negara lan digawe nganggo &lt;a href="Daging%20sapi%20enom"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20babi"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20domba"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iwak%20kalkun"&gt;kalkun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt; utawa protein sayuran bertekstur minangka alternatif &lt;a href="vegetarian"&gt;vegetarian&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Veganisme"&gt;vegan&lt;/a&gt;. Iku mirip banget karo escalope sajian ing &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;, tonkatsu ing &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="milanesa"&gt;milanesa&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Itali"&gt;Itali&lt;/a&gt;a, &lt;a href="M%C3%A8ksiko"&gt;Meksiko&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Uruguay"&gt;Uruguay&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paraguay"&gt;Paraguay&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Arg%C3%A8ntina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Brasil"&gt;Brasil&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Stik%20pitik%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;steak goreng pitik&lt;/a&gt; ing Amerika Selatan.

