<doc id="173932" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173932" title="Gluten gandum">
Gluten gandum

Gluten gandum minangka &lt;a href="Pangan"&gt;panganan sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka lem, &lt;a href="Prot%C3%A9in"&gt;protein&lt;/a&gt; utama &lt;a href="Gandhum"&gt;gandum&lt;/a&gt;. Iki digawe kanthi ngumbah &lt;a href="Adhonan"&gt;adonan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Glepung"&gt;tepung&lt;/a&gt; gandum nganggo banyu nganti kabeh butiran &lt;a href="Pathi"&gt;pati&lt;/a&gt; wis dicopot, nganti gluten sing ora larut minangka massa elastis, sing banjur dimasak sadurunge dipangan. 
Gluten gandum minangka alternatif panganan dhasar saka &lt;a href="Dhel%C3%A9"&gt;kedele&lt;/a&gt; kayata &lt;a href="tahu"&gt;tahu&lt;/a&gt;, sing kadang digunakake minangka &lt;a href="analog%20daging"&gt;analog daging&lt;/a&gt;. Sawetara jinis lem gandum duwe tekstur kenyal utawa lurus sing meh padha karo daging tinimbang pengganti liyane. Gluten gandum asring digunakake tinimbang daging ing &lt;a href="Diet%20makrobiotik"&gt;masakan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Masakan%20Asia"&gt;Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Olahan%20vegetarian"&gt;vegetarian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Masakan%20Budha"&gt;Buddha&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Diet%20makrobiotik"&gt;makrobiotik&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Bebek%20ngguyu"&gt;Bebek mock&lt;/a&gt; minangka umume digunakake kanggo lem gandum.
