<doc id="174009" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174009" title="Tortang talong">
Tortang talong

Tortang talong, uga dikenal minangka omelette eggplant, iku salah sawijining olahan Filipino &lt;a href="Omel%C3%A8t"&gt;omelette&lt;/a&gt; digawe dening pan-frying &lt;a href="panggang"&gt;panggang&lt;/a&gt; kabèh &lt;a href="T%C3%A9rong"&gt;eggplants&lt;/a&gt; dipped ing dicampur endhog. Iki minangka &lt;a href="sarapan"&gt;sarapan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mangan%20awan"&gt;makan siang sing&lt;/a&gt; populer ing &lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt;. Varian tortang talong sing umum digunakake yaiku talong rellenong, sing diiseni daging, panganan laut, lan / utawa sayuran.
