<doc id="174025" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174025" title="Smulpaj">
Smulpaj

Smulpaj (pie crumb) minangka &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; cuci &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;mulut&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt;. Beda karo pai tradisional amarga ora duwe cangkang &lt;a href="Pastry"&gt;jajanan&lt;/a&gt; ; nanging, tambalan ditambah langsung ing sajian pie sawise ndhuk. &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;Butter&lt;/a&gt; wis pipis &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="glepung%20gandum"&gt;glepung gandum&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="oatmeal"&gt;oatmeal&lt;/a&gt; menyang crumbly keuangan sing wis strewn liwat isi sanès. Iki banjur dipanggang menyang kerak. Smulpaj umume digawe karo apel, &lt;a href="rhubarb"&gt;rhubarb&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="Bilb%C3%A9ri"&gt;bilberry&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Bilb%C3%A9ri"&gt;disajeni&lt;/a&gt; nganggo &lt;a href="krim%20kocok"&gt;krim kocok&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Saus%20vanilla"&gt;saos vanilla&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="%C3%88s%20krim"&gt;es krim&lt;/a&gt;.
