<doc id="174028" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174028" title="Gulung ésuk">
Gulung ésuk

Gulung esuk utawa sarapan bap yaiku &lt;a href="Roti%20gulung"&gt;gulung roti sing&lt;/a&gt; kenyal lan kenyal sing misuwur ing &lt;a href="Sekotlan"&gt;Skotlandia&lt;/a&gt;. Varian yaiku gulung sing dipecat kanthi apik, diwenehi rasa sing luwih kuat nalika fermentasi massal lan dipanggang kanthi suhu sing luwih dhuwur. 
Gulung esuk Skotlandia ora dituku kanthi tradisional saka supermarket; luwih becik dituku saka &lt;a href="toko%20roti"&gt;toko roti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Warung%20wartawan"&gt;koran&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Minimarket"&gt;toko pojok, toko&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Toko%20jagal"&gt;jagal&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Toko%20jagal"&gt;toko&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Toko%20iwak%20lan%20chip"&gt;iwak lan chip&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging saiki, supermarket kayata &lt;a href="Scotmid"&gt;Scotmid wis menehi hasil&lt;/a&gt; karo toko roti lokal kanggo nyedhiyakake gulungan ing toko.
