<doc id="174029" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174029" title="Sarapan gulung">
Sarapan gulung

Gulung sarapan (#ALIH) yaiku &lt;a href="Roti%20gulung"&gt;gulung roti sing&lt;/a&gt; diisi karo unsur sarapan tradisional. Disedhiyakake ing macem-macem toko serbaguna, newsagents, supermarket, pom bensin, lan restoran santai ing saindenging Irlandia. 
Gulung sarapan biasane kalebu roti utawa &lt;a href="Baguette"&gt;baguette sing&lt;/a&gt; ngemot siji utawa luwih isi kayata &lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20bakon"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pudhing%20ireng"&gt;puding&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pudhing%20putih"&gt;putih&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Pudhing%20ireng"&gt;ireng&lt;/a&gt;, mentega, &lt;a href="jamur"&gt;jamur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="tomat"&gt;tomat&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="saos%20tomat"&gt;saos tomat&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Saos%20coklat"&gt;saus coklat&lt;/a&gt;. Ing sawetara kasus, &lt;a href="Hash%20soklat"&gt;coklat hash&lt;/a&gt;, kacang panggang utawa &lt;a href="Endhog%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;endhog goreng&lt;/a&gt; bisa ditambahake. Gulung kasebut biasane dadi salah siji saka telung macem-macem jinis: &lt;a href="Roti%20lapis%20prau%20silem"&gt;gulung jinis "kapal selam" sing&lt;/a&gt; lembut, &lt;a href="Roti%20gulung"&gt;gulung nedha&lt;/a&gt; bunder sing bunder, utawa demi-baguette. Demi-baguette disebar menyang toko sing dipanggang lan dibekukan, saengga toko bisa cepet manggang roti kanggo roti "sing anyar dipanggang". Sandwich "sarapan sedina muput" sing nampilake sawetara utawa kabeh bahan ing ndhuwur roti lapis &lt;a href="Roti%20iris"&gt;roti irisan&lt;/a&gt; tradisional bisa digunakake.
