A sandwich keju iku dhasar &lt;a href="sandwich"&gt;sandwich&lt;/a&gt; digawé karo siji utawa liyane varieties saka &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt; ing sembarang Urut saka roti, kaya ta roti warata utawa roti gandum, sing uga nyakup nyebar kaya ta butter utawa &lt;a href="Mayon%C3%A8s"&gt;mayonnaise&lt;/a&gt;. Sandwich keju liyane yaiku &lt;a href="sandwich%20limburger"&gt;sandwich limburger&lt;/a&gt;. Daging sing wis dimasak bisa ditambahake ing sandwich keju, kaya ta sandwich &lt;a href="Sandwich%20keju%20lan%20keju"&gt;ham lan keju&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Roti%20isi%20babi%2C%20endhog%20lan%20k%C3%A8ju"&gt;daging babi, endhog lan sandwich keju&lt;/a&gt;.

