<doc id="174079" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174079" title="Tart Manchester">
Tart Manchester

Manchester tart punika salah sawijining olahan Inggris tradisional baking &lt;a href="tart"&gt;tart&lt;/a&gt; dumadi saka &lt;a href="Pastry%20kerak%20cekak"&gt;shortcrust jajanan&lt;/a&gt; Nihan, nyebar karo raspberry &lt;a href="S%C3%A9l%C3%A9%20woh"&gt;senggol&lt;/a&gt;, dijamin karo &lt;a href="custard"&gt;custard&lt;/a&gt; Isi lan paling ndhuwur karo flakes saka &lt;a href="Krambil"&gt;klapa&lt;/a&gt; lan Cherry Maraschino. Variasi, utamane umum ing Wrexham, duwe lapisan &lt;a href="Gedhang"&gt;pisang sing&lt;/a&gt; diiris tipis ing sangisore wadi.

