Sandwich tenderloin daging babi, uga dikenal minangka roti lapis tenderloin sandwich alias BPT, ngemot &lt;a href="Breaded%20cutlet"&gt;cutlet roti lan gorengan sing&lt;/a&gt; padha karo &lt;a href="Wiener%20schnitzel"&gt;Wiener Schnitzel&lt;/a&gt; lan misuwur ing wilayah Midwest Amerika Serikat, utamane ing negara bagian &lt;a href="Indiana"&gt;Indiana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Illinois"&gt;Illinois&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Missouri"&gt;Missouri&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Iowa"&gt;Iowa&lt;/a&gt;. Sandwich kasebut diklaim asale saka restoran Nick's Kitchen ing Huntington, Indiana (cedhak Benteng Wayne). 
