<doc id="174149" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174149" title="Iwak atlas">
Iwak atlas

Atlas Daging (Der Fleischatlas) minangka laporan taunan, diterbitake dening Heinrich Böll Foundation lan Friends of the Earth Europe, babagan metode lan pengaruh pertanian kewan industri lan industri daging. Terdiri saka 27 esai cekak saka macem-macem penulis, laporan kasebut bertujuan kanggo menehi informasi marang konsumen babagan pengaruh &lt;a href="Daging"&gt;konsumsi daging tumrap&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kamlaratan"&gt;kemlaratan global&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pamanasan%20global"&gt;perubahan iklim&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kamulyan%20k%C3%A9wan"&gt;kesejahteraan kewan&lt;/a&gt;, keanekaragaman hayati, lan migrasi para pekerja. Meat Atlas pisanan diterbitake ing basa Jerman ing taun 2013, lan ing basa Jerman lan basa Inggris ing taun 2014, kalorone duwe &lt;a href="Lis%C3%A8nsi%20Creative%20Commons"&gt;lisensi Creative Commons&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Lis%C3%A8nsi%20Creative%20Commons"&gt;CC BY-SA&lt;/a&gt; 3.0). Editor eksekutif yaiku Christine Chemnitz saka Heinrich Böll Foundation lan Stanka Becheva saka Friends of the Earth Europe. 
