<doc id="174175" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174175" title="Mi Vietnam">
Mi Vietnam

&lt;a href="Olahan%20Vi%C3%A8tnam"&gt;Masakan Vietnam&lt;/a&gt; kalebu maneka werna jinis &lt;a href="mi"&gt;mi&lt;/a&gt;. Iki asring diwenehake ing sup nanging uga disajikake kanthi langsung.

