Remoulade

Rémoulade ;]) yaiku &lt;a href="Saos"&gt;saus&lt;/a&gt; adhem &lt;a href="Olah-olahan%20Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt; adhedhasar &lt;a href="Mayon%C3%A8s"&gt;mayones&lt;/a&gt;. Sanajan padha karo &lt;a href="saos%20tartar"&gt;saos tartar&lt;/a&gt;, umume luwih &lt;a href="Kuning"&gt;kekuningan&lt;/a&gt;, kadhang-kadhang rasane &lt;a href="kari"&gt;kari&lt;/a&gt;, lan kadhang ngemot acar utawa &lt;a href="Piccalilli"&gt;piccalilli sing&lt;/a&gt; dicincang. Uga bisa ngemot horseradish, &lt;a href="paprika"&gt;paprika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iwak%20teri"&gt;teri&lt;/a&gt;, caper lan barang liyane. Nalika waé asli ana bisa kanggo porsi karo daging, iku saiki luwih kerep dianggo minangka &lt;a href="Bumbu%20sisih"&gt;bumbu&lt;/a&gt; sauce utawa dipping, utamané kanggo tunggal, plaice, lan roti laut (kayata &lt;a href="Kepithing"&gt;Kepiting&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Iwak%20Salmon"&gt;salmon&lt;/a&gt; roti). Rémoulade digunakake ing Prancis, Dhènemarken, Èslan, Kepulauan Pharur, Jerman, Swèdhen, Nurwègen, Polen lan ing Amerika Serikat, utamane ing &lt;a href="masakan%20Louisiana%20Creole"&gt;masakan Louisiana Creole&lt;/a&gt;. Iki asring digunakake nganggo &lt;a href="Kenthang%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;kentang goreng&lt;/a&gt;, ing ndhuwur daging &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;sapi&lt;/a&gt; panggang, lan minangka bumbu &lt;a href="Hot%20dog"&gt;asu panas&lt;/a&gt;, sanajan ana macem-macem aplikasi liyane

