<doc id="174191" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174191" title="Kenthang pakuburan">
Kenthang pakuburan

Kentang panguburan (uga casserole coklat hash, coklat hase keju, kentang kasebut, utawa kentang pesta) minangka &lt;a href="Panganan%20panas"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt; tradisional utawa &lt;a href="Casserole"&gt;kaserol&lt;/a&gt; sing misuwur ing Amerika &lt;a href="Intermountain%20Kulon"&gt;Intermountain Kulon&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Amerika%20tengah"&gt;Midwest&lt;/a&gt;. Anggota &lt;a href="Greja%20Yesus%20Kristus%20Santo%20Paling%20Pungkasan"&gt;Greja Yesus Kristus Santo Paling Pungkasan&lt;/a&gt; (Greja LDS) nyebut kasserole " &lt;a href="Panguburan"&gt;pemakaman&lt;/a&gt; " kentang amarga umume disajikake minangka &lt;a href="Panganan%20sisih"&gt;panganan sajian&lt;/a&gt; nalika nedha bengi upacara tradisional sawise pemakaman, kayata sing direncanakake dening anggota &lt;a href="Lembaga%20Bantuan"&gt;Relief Society&lt;/a&gt; (organisasi &lt;a href="Organisasi%20%28Greja%20LDS%29"&gt;LDS Church&lt;/a&gt;). Nanging sajian kasebut uga disajikake ing nedha bengi greja liyane, ing njero njaba ruangan Greja LDS (kayata nedha bengi), uga ing &lt;a href="potluck"&gt;potluck&lt;/a&gt; lan acara sosial liyane. 
Panganan biasane kalebu &lt;a href="Hash%20soklat"&gt;coklat hash&lt;/a&gt; utawa kentang cubed, keju (&lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju%20cheddar"&gt;cheddar&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Parmigiano-Reggiano"&gt;Parmesan&lt;/a&gt;), bawang, &lt;a href="sup%20krim"&gt;sup krim&lt;/a&gt; (pitik, jamur, utawa celery) utawa &lt;a href="Saos"&gt;saus&lt;/a&gt; krim, krim asem, lan topping butter karo &lt;a href="Kripik%20jagung"&gt;serpih jagung&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Kripik%20kenthang"&gt;keripik kentang sing wis diremuk&lt;/a&gt;. Bahan ing sawetara variasi kalebu &lt;a href="ham"&gt;ham&lt;/a&gt; panggang cubed, &lt;a href="Kapri"&gt;kacang polong&lt;/a&gt; beku, utawa &lt;a href="Brokoli"&gt;florok brokoli&lt;/a&gt;. Kentang panguburan disebutake ing seri buku "Nice Girl" lan Molly Harper " Molly Harper ", minangka masakan tradisional Selatan.
