<doc id="174198" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174198" title="Pollock roe">
Pollock roe

Pollock roe, uga pollack roe, (uga dikenal minangka myeongnan lan tarako) yaiku salah sawijining olahan &lt;a href="Endhog%20iwak"&gt;roe&lt;/a&gt; saka Alaska pollock (Gadus chalcogrammus) sing, sanajan jenenge, kalebu spesies cod. Rohe pollock asin minangka bahan kuliner sing populer ing masakan Korea, &lt;a href="Masakan%20Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Masakan%20Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;.

