<doc id="174201" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174201" title="Caldeirada">
Caldeirada

Caldeirada (Portuguese pronunciation: [kaɫdɐjˈɾaðɐ], [kɐwdejɾadɐ]) iku Portugis lan Galician (Northwestern &lt;a href="Sepanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt; godhok wilayah) iwak ingkang kapérang saking macem-macem iwak lan &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt;, bebarengan karo úa A nelayan &lt;a href="Godhogan"&gt;godhok&lt;/a&gt;, sajian wis diterangake minangka "a muddle iwak sing beda-beda gumantung saka kutha menyang kutha lan gumantung saka apa sing bisa ditindakake para nelayan. " Caldeirada padha karo jinis rebusan iwak liyane, kayata &lt;a href="bouillabaisse"&gt;bouillabaisse&lt;/a&gt; Prancis, &lt;a href="Kakavia%20%28sup%29"&gt;kakavia&lt;/a&gt; Yunani, zarzuela Spanyol lan &lt;a href="cacciucco"&gt;cacciucco&lt;/a&gt; Italia
