<doc id="174211" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174211" title="Muhammara">
Muhammara

Muhammara (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: محمرة‎‎ "reddened") utawa mhammara punika &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;mrico panas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Saos%20celupan"&gt;dip&lt;/a&gt; Originally saka &lt;a href="Aleppo"&gt;Aleppo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Suriah"&gt;Suriah&lt;/a&gt;, ketemu ing Levantine lan Turki masakan. Ing Turki sisih kulon, muhammara diarani acuka.
Bahan utamane biasane mrico seger utawa garing, biasane &lt;a href="Mrica%20Aleppo"&gt;mrico Aleppo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Walnut"&gt;kenari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Panir"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Lenga%20ja%C3%A9tun"&gt;minyak zaitun&lt;/a&gt;. Uga ngemot &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;papak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;jus lemon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="molase%20delima"&gt;molase delima&lt;/a&gt;, lan kadang-kadang rempah-rempah (kayata &lt;a href="Jinten%20putih"&gt;jinten&lt;/a&gt;). Bisa dihiasi nganggo &lt;a href="Godhong%20Mint"&gt;godhong mint&lt;/a&gt;.
