<doc id="174221" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174221" title="Murături">
Murături

Murături (basa Rumania kanggo asinan) minangka salah sawijining jinis sayuran utawa woh sing &lt;a href="Pangaseman"&gt;diasinake&lt;/a&gt; ing brine utawa &lt;a href="cuka"&gt;cuka&lt;/a&gt;, kaya sing ditemokake ing masakan Romania lan Moldova. Acar umume digawe saka bahan panganan sing ditandur kanthi lokal kayata bit, &lt;a href="timun"&gt;timun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tomat"&gt;tomat ijo&lt;/a&gt; (Rumania: gogonele), &lt;a href="Wortel%20jangan"&gt;wortel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kul"&gt;kubis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lombok%20lonc%C3%A8ng"&gt;paprika&lt;/a&gt;, melon, &lt;a href="jamur"&gt;jamur&lt;/a&gt;, turnip, &lt;a href="Sl%C3%A8dri"&gt;celery&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="kembang%20kol"&gt;kembang kol&lt;/a&gt;. 
