<doc id="174237" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174237" title="Sabich">
Sabich

Sabich utawa sabih (#ALIH‎
  [sabiχ]) iku salah sawijining Israel sandwich saka &lt;a href="pita"&gt;pita&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="laffa"&gt;laffa&lt;/a&gt; roti diiseni karo eggplant goreng, nggodhok endhog, Alloh Chatzutz, parsley, Amba lan &lt;a href="tahini"&gt;tahini&lt;/a&gt; sauce. Bahan-bahan kasebut adhedhasar sarapan &lt;a href="Shabbat"&gt;Shabbat&lt;/a&gt; tradisional Irak. Sabich didol ing akeh bisnis ing saindenging Israel.
Sabich, disajekake ing roti pita, biasane ngemot irisan &lt;a href="T%C3%A9rong"&gt;terong&lt;/a&gt; goreng, endhog mateng, saos &lt;a href="tahini"&gt;tahini&lt;/a&gt; tipis (tahini, jus &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;lemon&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;bawang putih&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Salad%20Israel"&gt;Salad Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9ters%C3%A9li"&gt;peterseli sing&lt;/a&gt; dicincang, lan &lt;a href="Amba%20%28bumbu%29"&gt;amba&lt;/a&gt;. Sawetara versi nggunakake kentang rebus. &lt;a href="Haminados"&gt;Biasane&lt;/a&gt; digawe nganggo endhog &lt;a href="haminados"&gt;haminados&lt;/a&gt;, dimasak alon ing &lt;a href="Cholent"&gt;Hamin&lt;/a&gt; nganti dadi coklat. Miturut pilihan restoran, bisa &lt;a href="Zhug"&gt;diwenehi zhug&lt;/a&gt; ijo utawa abang minangka bumbu lan ditaburi &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt; cincang.
