<doc id="174279" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174279" title="Olahan Lugbara">
Olahan Lugbara

Masakan Lugbara minangka salah sawijining &lt;a href="Sesuguh"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Afrika%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Afrika Wétan&lt;/a&gt; lan Lado Enclave kuno. Masyarakat Lugbara ing sisih kidul -kulon &lt;a href="Uganda"&gt;Uganda&lt;/a&gt; lan sisih &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Dh%C3%A9mokratik%20Kongo"&gt;Lor-&lt;/a&gt; wétan &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Dh%C3%A9mokratik%20Kongo"&gt;DR Kongo&lt;/a&gt; mangan ora mung panganan sayur-sayuran, nanging uga kéwan kaya wedhus, sapi plus ope (guineafowls) lan nyekel &lt;a href="K%C3%A9wan%20gegremetan"&gt;serangga&lt;/a&gt; kaya onya (&lt;a href="Rayap"&gt;semut putih&lt;/a&gt; / rayap bersayap) kanggo &lt;a href="Pangan"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; sing diarani nyaka ing basa Lugbara standar sing digunakake ing Arua. &lt;a href="Ket%C3%A9la%20pohung"&gt;Singkong&lt;/a&gt; glepung sok nyampur lan omben karo millet utawa &lt;a href="Canth%C3%A8l"&gt;sorghum&lt;/a&gt; kaya posho utawa ugali punika panganan pokok lan diarani enya (sa) [kalo utawa Sungai Biuh (a) ing Ateso, &lt;a href="fufu"&gt;fufu&lt;/a&gt; ing Afrika Kulon] diiringi karo sawetara &lt;a href="Sop"&gt;sayur sup&lt;/a&gt; pasugatan. &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;Rice&lt;/a&gt;, yams, &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt; (kalebu nggodhok plus mashing mutere pepe) lan matoke (&lt;a href="Kukus"&gt;steamed&lt;/a&gt; utawa mashed &lt;a href="Gedhang"&gt;bananas&lt;/a&gt;) sing uga dipangan. Ing ngisor iki minangka dhaptar sawetara panganan khas gaya Lugbara sing bisa ditemokake ing West Nile Restaurant, Ariwara Town (DR Congo), Arua Park ing &lt;a href="Kampala"&gt;Kampala&lt;/a&gt; (ibukutha Uganda) lan akeh omah utawa kafetaria sing ngurmati masakan tradisional Lugbara. Iki kalebu anya i'di (&lt;a href="Bubur%20%28panganan%29"&gt;bubur&lt;/a&gt; millet kadang dicampur karo kacang gandum - ala utawa pasta &lt;a href="Wij%C3%A8n"&gt;simsim&lt;/a&gt; - anyu); lesu (&lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt;) lan maaku i'di (&lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt; porridge, salah siji seger utawa pepe nanging mashed) plus &lt;a href="woh"&gt;woh&lt;/a&gt; jus kaya susu jagung: Young (raw) jagung kabungkus, squeezed metu saka iku lan nggodhok kanggo ngombé, ora dipangan kabeh kaya &lt;a href="Wong%20Indian"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; nindakake; lan mengu i'di - &lt;a href="Jus%20%28omb%C3%A9nan%29"&gt;jus&lt;/a&gt; mangga disiapake kanthi masak &lt;a href="pelem"&gt;pelem&lt;/a&gt;, mula nalika adhem, sampeyan jus banjur prentah karo gula. Iki kalebu anya i'di (&lt;a href="Bubur%20%28panganan%29"&gt;bubur&lt;/a&gt; millet kadang dicampur karo kacang gandum - ala utawa pasta &lt;a href="Wij%C3%A8n"&gt;simsim&lt;/a&gt; - anyu); lesu (&lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt;) lan maaku i'di (&lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt; porridge, salah siji seger utawa pepe nanging mashed) plus &lt;a href="woh"&gt;woh&lt;/a&gt; jus kaya susu jagung: Young (raw) jagung kabungkus, squeezed metu saka iku lan nggodhok kanggo ngombé, ora dipangan kabeh kaya &lt;a href="Wong%20Indian"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; nindakake; lan mengu i'di - &lt;a href="Jus%20%28omb%C3%A9nan%29"&gt;jus&lt;/a&gt; mangga disiapake kanthi masak &lt;a href="pelem"&gt;pelem&lt;/a&gt;, mula nalika adhem, sampeyan jus banjur prentah karo gula.
