<doc id="174289" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174289" title="Olahan Moldova">
Olahan Moldova

Masakan Moldovan minangka gaya masak sing ana gandhengane karo masarakat &lt;a href="Moldova"&gt;Moldova&lt;/a&gt; lan wilayah &lt;a href="Transnistria"&gt;Transnistria sing&lt;/a&gt; istirahat. Isine utamane kalebu bahan-bahan kayata daging sapi, daging babi, kentang, kubis, lan macem-macem biji-bijian sereal. Masakan lokal mirip banget karo Romania, lan uga inspirasi lan elemen saka masakan liyane ing wilayah kasebut, kalebu Yunani, Polen, Ukraina, lan &lt;a href="Masakan%20Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi pengaruh gedhe sing ditinggalake dening masakan Ottoman. Moldova (&lt;a href="chernozem"&gt;chernozem&lt;/a&gt;) sing subur ngasilake &lt;a href="Anggur%20%28woh%29"&gt;woh-&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="woh"&gt;woh&lt;/a&gt;an, &lt;a href="Woh"&gt;woh-wohan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;sayuran&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wiji-wijian"&gt;biji-bijian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Susu"&gt;susu sing akeh&lt;/a&gt;, sing kabeh bisa digunakake ing masakan nasional. Lemah ireng sing subur digabungake karo nggunakake cara tetanen tradisional supaya bisa tuwuh akeh panganan ing Moldova.

