Hutspot

Hutspot (Walanda), hochepot (Prancis), utawa hotchpotch (Inggris), minangka sajian &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt; rebus lan &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;tumbuk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wortel%20jangan"&gt;wortel&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt; kanthi sejarah dawa ing &lt;a href="Masakan%20Walanda"&gt;masakan&lt;/a&gt; tradisional &lt;a href="Masakan%20Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt;. Hutspot uga ditemokake ing &lt;a href="Masakan%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;masakan Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; amarga ikatan kolonial.
Masakan kentang tumbuk Walanda kayata &lt;a href="stamppot"&gt;stamppot&lt;/a&gt; kalebu boerenkool ("kubis petani" utawa &lt;a href="kale"&gt;kale&lt;/a&gt;), andijvie (&lt;a href="Awet%20terus"&gt;endive&lt;/a&gt;), spruitjes (&lt;a href="Brussels%20sprouts"&gt;sprouts brussels&lt;/a&gt;) lan / utawa zuurkool (&lt;a href="Sau%C3%A9rkraut"&gt;sauerkraut&lt;/a&gt;), umume nganggo rookworst (&lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt; asap) utawa daging &lt;a href="Daging%20bakon"&gt;babi&lt;/a&gt; asap. Tekstur chunky sajian kasebut mbedakake saka panganan adhedhasar kentang liyane sing luwih murni. More a hearty meal saka sajian sisih, hutspot banget populer sak &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt; mongso. Rotmos sajian &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt; - "root mash" - padha, mung kanggo bawang sing diganti karo &lt;a href="Rutabaga"&gt;swede&lt;/a&gt; (kålrot). Potch, iringan tradisional Welsh kanggo panganan daging, uga digawe karo kentang tumbuk, wortel, swede, parsnip lan kadang sayuran oyot liyane. Sanajan jeneng sing padha, iki sajian sing béda karo &lt;a href="Hochepot"&gt;hutsepot&lt;/a&gt; Flemish, daging sing dienggo sayuran sing durung mateng.
