<doc id="174405" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174405" title="Barbekyu roti isi">
Barbekyu roti isi

A sandwich barbecue punika &lt;a href="sandwich"&gt;sandwich&lt;/a&gt; sing biasane disiapake karo &lt;a href="Barbecue"&gt;barbecued&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt;. Sawetara jinis daging digunakake kanggo nyiyapake roti bakar panggang. Sawetara jinis nggunakake daging sing wis dimasak sing dudu barbekyu, nanging kalebu &lt;a href="Saos%20barbecue"&gt;saus bakar bakar&lt;/a&gt;. Akeh variasi, kalebu variasi regional, ana, uga macem-macem jinis gaya masak, persiapan lan bahan-bahan.
Akeh daging lan gaya persiapan kanggo roti bakar panggang ana. Daging bisa ngiris, disigar utawa ditarik, lan macem-macem jinis sing digunakake, kayata &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Babi%20suwir"&gt;ditarik daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bokong%20Boston"&gt;daging babi Pundhak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, daging sapi &lt;a href="Brisk%C3%A9t"&gt;balung sikil&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iga%20babi"&gt;Iga daging babi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kalkun%20domestik"&gt;kalkun&lt;/a&gt;. Sawetara versi nggunakake daging &lt;a href="Pangasepan"&gt;asap&lt;/a&gt; alon-alon. Sandwich &lt;a href="Saos%20barbecue"&gt;barbekyu&lt;/a&gt; biasane kalebu &lt;a href="Saos%20barbecue"&gt;saus barbecue kanggo disiyapake&lt;/a&gt;, yaiku nalika daging dimasak, saos ing sandwich, utawa kalorone. Sawetara daging bisa dibumboni nganggo &lt;a href="Bumbu%20balur"&gt;rempah&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Bumbu%20balur"&gt;rempah&lt;/a&gt;. Sawetara roti lapis bisa nggunakake daging sing wis dimasak sing dudu barbecue, nanging kalebu saus bakar bakar. &lt;a href="Coleslaw"&gt;Coleslaw&lt;/a&gt; sok-sok disajikake karo sandwich barbekyu, ing sandwich dhewe utawa minangka &lt;a href="Panganan%20sisih"&gt;sajian sampingan&lt;/a&gt;. Kadang &lt;a href="Ngos%C3%A8ng"&gt;sauteed&lt;/a&gt; sayuran kayata bawang lan papak uga digunakake. Sawetara versi sing disiapake nganggo daging sapi kalebu bagean sing ramping lan lemu saka potongan daging sapi kanggo nambah rasane. Sandwich barbecue sing wis dikemas uga diprodhuksi. 
