<doc id="174407" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174407" title="Lobster gulung">
Lobster gulung

Gulung lobster minangka sandwich sing asli saka New England lan uga misuwur ing Maritim Kanada. Iki digawe saka daging &lt;a href="Lobster"&gt;lobster sing&lt;/a&gt; disajikake ing roti panggang gaya asu sing panas kanthi bukaan ing sisih ndhuwur tinimbang sisihane. Isi bisa uga ngemot &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;butter&lt;/a&gt;, jus &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;lemon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrica ireng&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi varian ing sawetara wilayah ing New England ngganti butter karo &lt;a href="Mayon%C3%A8s"&gt;mayonnaise&lt;/a&gt;. Versi liya bisa ngemot &lt;a href="Sl%C3%A8dri"&gt;celery&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Loncang"&gt;daun bawang sing&lt;/a&gt; diced. &lt;a href="Kripik%20kenthang"&gt;Kripik kentang&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Kenthang%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;kentang goreng minangka&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Panganan%20sisih"&gt;sisi&lt;/a&gt; khas. 
Lobster rolls minangka panganan musiman sing populer, utamane ing turis ing saindhenging &lt;a href="Para%20Maritim"&gt;propinsi Maritime&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Kanadhah"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt;, utamane &lt;a href="Nova%20Scotia"&gt;Nova Scotia&lt;/a&gt;, sing uga ana ing &lt;a href="Hamburger"&gt;roti hamburger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="baguette"&gt;baguette&lt;/a&gt;, utawa jinis &lt;a href="Roti%20gulung"&gt;roti liyane&lt;/a&gt; lan uga ing kanthong &lt;a href="pita"&gt;pita&lt;/a&gt;. Pesenan sisih tradisional yaiku &lt;a href="Kripik%20kenthang"&gt;keripik kentang&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Timun%20acar"&gt;acar dill&lt;/a&gt;.
