<doc id="174446" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174446" title="Sirup sari">
Sirup sari

Sirup sari uga dikenal minangka &lt;a href="T%C3%A8t%C3%A8s"&gt;molase&lt;/a&gt; apel. Iki minangka salah sawijining olahan jinis &lt;a href="sirup"&gt;sirup&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Woh"&gt;buah&lt;/a&gt;. Iki minangka sirup opaque coklat kandel lan peteng kanthi rasa apel konsentrat. Werna molase apel luwih peteng tinimbang &lt;a href="madu"&gt;madu&lt;/a&gt; lan luwih tart banjur &lt;a href="Sirup%20mapel"&gt;sirup maple&lt;/a&gt;. Sirup apel jinis iki pisanan digawe ing kolonial Amerika. Luwih gampang njaga produk kaya sirup tinimbang apel seger sajrone wektu sing luwih suwe. Ing sirup cider diprodhuksi dening nggodhok manis cider nalika aduk, nganti &lt;a href="banyu"&gt;banyu&lt;/a&gt; isi cider wis &lt;a href="Panguapan"&gt;nguwab&lt;/a&gt;. Dadi, sirup sari minangka jinis sirup alami tanpa reagen tambahan. Akeh peternakan isih ngasilake sirup sari apel saiki ing &lt;a href="Maine"&gt;Maine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Massachusetts"&gt;Massachusetts&lt;/a&gt;, lan bagean liya ing New England. Sacara historis digunakake minangka agen pemanis kanthi macem-macem jinis &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;sayuran&lt;/a&gt;. Sirup sari apel biasane digunakake nalika nggawe &lt;a href="Bolu"&gt;kue&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kukis"&gt;cookie&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Res%C3%A8p"&gt;resep&lt;/a&gt; liyane. Uga ngemot &lt;a href="Hara"&gt;nutrisi&lt;/a&gt; kayata &lt;a href="Natriyum"&gt;natrium&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kaliyum"&gt;kalium&lt;/a&gt;, gula, &lt;a href="vitamin%20A"&gt;vitamin A&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="vitamin%20C"&gt;vitamin C&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kalsiyum"&gt;kalsium&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Magn%C3%A8siyum"&gt;magnesium&lt;/a&gt;. Iki minangka &lt;a href="tradhisi"&gt;tradhisi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pangan"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Wewengkon"&gt;regional sing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Spesies%20jroning%20bebaya%20cures"&gt;mbebayani&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;ing Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt;. 
