Malpua

Malpua minangka &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20dhadhar"&gt;pancake sing&lt;/a&gt; dadi &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; cuci &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;mulut&lt;/a&gt; utawa cemilan sing asale saka anak bawana India, sing populer ing &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="N%C3%A9pal"&gt;Nepal&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Banggalad%C3%A9sa"&gt;Bangladesh&lt;/a&gt;. Malpua misuwur ing &lt;a href="Banggalad%C3%A9sa"&gt;Bangladesh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Odisha"&gt;Odisha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Benggala%20Kulon"&gt;Benggala Kulon&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Maharashtra"&gt;Maharashtra&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="N%C3%A9pal"&gt;Nepal&lt;/a&gt;, sing dilayani sajrone festival bebarengan karo permen liyane.
