<doc id="174456" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174456" title="Saos Holland">
Saos Holland

Sauce Hollandaise (utawa ;]), biyèn uga diarani saos Walanda, yaiku emulsi &lt;a href="Kuning%20endhog"&gt;kuning telur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;mentega cair&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;jus lemon&lt;/a&gt; (utawa pangurangan anggur putih utawa cuka). Biasane dicampur &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt;, uga &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrica putih&lt;/a&gt; utawa cabai rawit.
