<doc id="174485" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174485" title="Gulungan legi">
Gulungan legi

A manis &lt;a href="Roti%20gulung"&gt;muter&lt;/a&gt; utawa manis &lt;a href="Roti%20bundher"&gt;bun&lt;/a&gt; nuduhake samubarang sawetara manis, baking, ragi - ragi &lt;a href="sarapan"&gt;sarapan&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan cuci mulut&lt;/a&gt; panganan. Padha bisa ngemot rempah-rempah, &lt;a href="Kacang%20gulung"&gt;perkakas&lt;/a&gt;, woh-wohan candied, etc., lan asring &lt;a href="gilap"&gt;gilap&lt;/a&gt; utawa paling ndhuwur karo &lt;a href="Glasir"&gt;kebentuk&lt;/a&gt;. Dibandhingake karo &lt;a href="Adhonan"&gt;adonan&lt;/a&gt; roti biasa, &lt;a href="Adhonan"&gt;adonan&lt;/a&gt; gulung manis umume duwe gula, lemak, endhog, lan ragi sing luwih dhuwur. Dheweke asring bunder, lan cukup cilik kanggo kalebu siji porsi. Iki beda-beda saka &lt;a href="Pastry"&gt;pastries&lt;/a&gt;, kang digawe saka tempel -like &lt;a href="Adhonan%20kuw%C3%A9"&gt;antuk giliran&lt;/a&gt; ; saka &lt;a href="Bolu"&gt;jajan&lt;/a&gt;, sing umume ragi utawa ragi kimia; lan saka &lt;a href="Dhonat"&gt;sik&lt;/a&gt;, sing wis &lt;a href="Gor%C3%A8ng%20kungkum"&gt;digorèng jero&lt;/a&gt;.
Gulung manis kadang es lan / utawa ngemot isine sing legi. Ing sawetara tradhisi, jinis ngisi lan dekorasi liyane digunakake, kayata kayu manis, &lt;a href="marzipan"&gt;marzipan&lt;/a&gt;, utawa woh-wohan permen.
