<doc id="174487" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174487" title="Allerheiligenstriezel">
Allerheiligenstriezel

Allerheiligenstriezel utawa mung Strietzel (jeneng regional kalebu Allerseelenzopf, Seelenspitze, Seelenbrot, utawa Allerseelenbreze) minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan kue ragi kepang. Jeneng kasebut tegese "jalinan All Saints" ing basa Inggris lan kalebu &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Khamir"&gt;ragi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cekak"&gt;shortening&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;butter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kismis"&gt;kismis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Gula"&gt;dekorasi gandum&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="wiji%20poppy"&gt;wiji poppy&lt;/a&gt;. Sawetara variasi regional uga kalebu &lt;a href="Rum%20%28unjukan%20mawi%20alkohol%29"&gt;rum&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;jus lemon&lt;/a&gt;.

