Bánh bía, kadhangkala dieja bánh pía, minangka salah sawijining jinis &lt;a href="Olahan%20Vi%C3%A8tnam"&gt;masakan Vietnam&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="b%C3%A1nh"&gt;bánh&lt;/a&gt; (diterjemahake kanthi longgar dadi "kue" utawa "roti"). &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20rembulan"&gt;Mooncake&lt;/a&gt; gaya Suzhou diadaptasi saka masakan Teochew. Jeneng Vietnam asale saka tembung &lt;a href="Basa%20Tyocyu"&gt;Teochew&lt;/a&gt; kanggo jajanan, "pia". Ing &lt;a href="Kutha%20Ho%20Chi%20Minh"&gt;Saigon&lt;/a&gt;, jajanan diarani "bánh bía" nalika ing Sóc Trăng lan Vũng Thơm dikenal kanthi "bánh Pía". Sawetara wong Vietnam ngarani bánh lột da, sing jarwané "peeling flakes pastry", lan sing saka wilayah Bến Tre ngarani bánh bao chi, sing jeneng &lt;a href="Mochi"&gt;Mochi ing&lt;/a&gt; papan liya ing Vietnam. Kandhutan populer kalebu durian, lemak daging babi abon, kuning telur asin, tempel &lt;a href="Kacang%20ijo"&gt;kacang mung&lt;/a&gt;, taro lan klapa.
