<doc id="174557" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174557" title="Crépinette">
Crépinette

Crépinette minangka &lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt; cilik lan rata, kadhangkala diarani bungkus sosis. Wujude padha karo patty sosis, bunder, lan rata. Iki digawe saka daging &lt;a href="Daging%20babi"&gt;babi sing&lt;/a&gt; dicincang utawa &lt;a href="Daging%20babi"&gt;digiling&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iwak%20kalkun"&gt;kalkun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20sapi%20enom"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20domba"&gt;wedhus&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;, lan bisa uga digawe saka &lt;a href="Truffles"&gt;truffle&lt;/a&gt;.
