The jibarito (pocapan hee-Bah-Ree-toh), punika &lt;a href="sandwich"&gt;sandwich&lt;/a&gt; digawe karo flattened, goreng ijo plantains tinimbang roti, &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;papak&lt;/a&gt; -flavored &lt;a href="Mayon%C3%A8s"&gt;mayonnaise&lt;/a&gt;, lan Isi sing biasane kalebu meat, &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt;, Lettuce lan &lt;a href="tomat"&gt;tomat&lt;/a&gt;. Jibarito asli duwe isi &lt;a href="Stik"&gt;steak&lt;/a&gt;, lan tetep dadi macem-macem jinis biasa, nanging bahan liyane, kayata &lt;a href="Pitik"&gt;daging pitik&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, umume.
Sandwich Amerika Latin liyane sing disajikake ing plantain goreng sadurunge jibarito. Dheweke kalebu spesialisasi masakan Kolombia sing diarani &lt;a href="Tostones"&gt;patacone&lt;/a&gt; lan penemuan 1991 dening Jorge Muñoz lan Coquí Feliciano sing dilayani ing restoran, Plátano Loco, ing Aguada, Puerto Rico. 
