Kalduny utawa kolduny (basa &lt;a href="basa%20B%C3%A9larus"&gt;Bélarus&lt;/a&gt;: калдуны́, Basa #ALIH, Litowenn, mung digunakake ing jamak) yaiku &lt;a href="pangsit"&gt;pangsit&lt;/a&gt; diisi saka &lt;a href="Adhonan"&gt;adonan&lt;/a&gt; tanpa &lt;a href="Adhonan"&gt;ragi&lt;/a&gt; ing masakan &lt;a href="Olahan%20B%C3%A9larusia"&gt;Bélarusia&lt;/a&gt;, Litowen, lan Polen, padha karo &lt;a href="pierogi"&gt;pierogi&lt;/a&gt; Polen, &lt;a href="Pelm%C3%A9ni"&gt;pelmeni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Masakan%20Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pierogi"&gt;vareniki&lt;/a&gt; Ukraina. Ing &lt;a href="Kulawarga%20basa%20Slavika"&gt;basa Slavia&lt;/a&gt; tembung kasebut tegese " pesulap " utawa " tukang sihir ", nanging ora jelas kepiye tembung kasebut digandhengake karo sajian kasebut.
