Burger kèju

Cheeseburger minangka &lt;a href="Hamburger"&gt;hamburger sing&lt;/a&gt; diwenehi &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt;. Biasane, irisan keju diselehake ing ndhuwur &lt;a href="patty"&gt;patty&lt;/a&gt; daging. Keju biasane ditambahake ing patty hamburger sing wis dimasak sakcepete sadurunge disajikake, saengga keju kasebut bisa ilang. Cheeseburgers bisa kalebu variasi struktur, bahan lan komposisi. Kaya dene hamburger liyane, cheeseburger bisa uga kalebu topping kaya ta salad, &lt;a href="tomat"&gt;tomat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Timun%20acar"&gt;acar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20bakon"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mayon%C3%A8s"&gt;mayones&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Saos%20tomat"&gt;ketchup&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="mustar"&gt;mustar&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing &lt;a href="Restoran%20fast%20food"&gt;restoran panganan cepat saji&lt;/a&gt;, keju sing digunakake ing cheeseburgers biasane &lt;a href="Keju%20sing%20wis%20diproses"&gt;keju olahan&lt;/a&gt;. Keju liyane sing bisa dileleh bisa digunakake minangka alternatif. Contone umum kaya ta &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju%20cheddar"&gt;cheddar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Keju%20Switserlan%20%28Amerika%20Utara%29"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="mozzarella"&gt;mozzarella&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju%20biru"&gt;Keju biru&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Keju%20jack%20mrico"&gt;jack mrico&lt;/a&gt;.

