<doc id="174634" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174634" title="Goetta">
Goetta

Goetta () iku daging lan gandum &lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt; utawa remukan saka inspirasi Jerman sing populer ing luwih wilayah Cincinnati. Utamane kasusun saka &lt;a href="Daging%20giling"&gt;daging ing ngisor&lt;/a&gt; (daging babi, utawa daging babi lan daging sapi), gandum lan rempah-rempah. Iki asline minangka sajian sing dimaksud kanggo &lt;a href="Livermush"&gt;njangkepi&lt;/a&gt; sajian &lt;a href="Livermush"&gt;daging sajrone&lt;/a&gt; panganan kanggo ngirit dhuwit, lan minangka panganan sing padha karo &lt;a href="scrapple"&gt;scrapple&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="livermush"&gt;livermush&lt;/a&gt;, sing uga dikembangake para imigran Jerman. 
Nalika goetta ana macem-macem bentuk, kabeh goetta adhedhasar daging sing dikombinasikake karo &lt;a href="Haver"&gt;gandum&lt;/a&gt; pin-head, "cara masak tradisional &lt;a href="Jerman%20Kurang"&gt;Jerman Rendah kanggo&lt;/a&gt; nggedhekake daging minimal kanggo menehi akeh wong.":244 Biasane goetta digawe saka daging babi, nanging sok-sok ngemot daging babi lan daging sapi sing padha. Goetta biasane rasane nganggo &lt;a href="Godhong%20teluk"&gt;godhong bay&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rosm%C3%A9ri"&gt;rosemary&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrico&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Paduka"&gt;thyme&lt;/a&gt;. Isine bawang lan kadang sayuran liyane. Standar USDA kanggo goetta kudu ngemot ora kurang saka 50% daging.
