<doc id="174646" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174646" title="Shankarpali">
Shankarpali

Shankarpali, shakkarpara, khurma, laktho, lakdi mithai, utawa mung mithai minangka &lt;a href="Nyamikan"&gt;camilan&lt;/a&gt; manis India. Shankarpali misuwur ing India Kulon, utamane ing India sisih lor khusus Uttar Pradesh &lt;a href=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Varian India Lor sing dikenal kanthi khurma utawa laktho uga misuwur ing negara-negara kayata Bihar, Jharkhand, lan Uttar Pradesh sisih wétan.. Iki uga dadi panganan sing populer ing antarane diaspora India ing &lt;a href="Fiji"&gt;Fiji&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Guyana"&gt;Guyana&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Trinidad%20lan%20Tobago"&gt;Trinidad lan Tobago&lt;/a&gt;, uga diasporas masing-masing ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Lor"&gt;Amerika Utara&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Karajan%20Manunggal"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ostrali"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Niu%20S%C3%A9lan"&gt;Selandia Baru&lt;/a&gt;. Secara tradisional disenengi minangka perawatan ing Diwali. Kandhungan &lt;a href="karbohidrat"&gt;karbohidrat&lt;/a&gt;, dadi energi sing cepet. Bisa dadi legi, ora nguntungke utawa pedhes, gumantung saka cara nggawe. Shankarpali digawe saka adonan &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lenga%20samin"&gt;ghee&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tepung%20Maida"&gt;maida&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="S%C3%A9molina"&gt;semolina&lt;/a&gt;.
