<doc id="174678" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174678" title="Olahan Uttar Pradesh">
Olahan Uttar Pradesh

Masakan Uttar Pradesh saka negara Uttar Pradesh (UP) sing dununge ing India Lor. Masakan UP duwe macem-macem pasugatan. Masakan kasebut kalebu masakan vegetarian lan non-vegetarian kanthi macem-macem jinis. Minangka negara sing akeh, masakan UP nuduhake akeh pasugatan lan resep-resep karo negara-negara tanggané Delhi, Uttarakhand, Haryana lan Kajaba masakan asli, Mughlai lan &lt;a href="Masakan%20Awadh"&gt;Awadhi minangka&lt;/a&gt; rong jinis masakan sing misuwur ing negara kasebut.
Amarga gandum minangka panganan pokok ing negara kasebut, roti penting banget. &lt;a href="Roti"&gt;Roti&lt;/a&gt; umume roti sing rata; mung sawetara jinis roti sing diangkat. Roti bisa digawe saka macem-macem jinis glepung lan bisa digawe kanthi macem-macem cara. Roti Popular kalebu naan tandoori (&lt;a href="naan"&gt;naan&lt;/a&gt; panggang ing &lt;a href="tandoor"&gt;tandoor&lt;/a&gt;), tandoori &lt;a href="Roti%20India"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kulcha"&gt;kulcha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Taftan%20%28roti%29"&gt;taftan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="sheermal"&gt;sheermal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rumali%20Roti"&gt;Rumali Roti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paratha"&gt;Paratha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sogara"&gt;millet&lt;/a&gt; (millet glepung flatbread), lan &lt;a href="Paratha"&gt;lachha paratha&lt;/a&gt;.
