<doc id="174767" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174767" title="Daging analog">
Daging analog

Analogi daging minangka zat kaya daging sing digawe saka tanduran. Istilah sing luwih umum yaiku daging adhedhasar tanduran, daging vegan, pengganti daging, daging mock, alternatif daging, daging tiruan, utawa daging vegetarian, utawa, kadang-kadang luwih akeh, daging palsu utawa daging palsu. Analogi daging biasane kira-kira kualitas &lt;a href="%C3%88st%C3%A8tika"&gt;estetis&lt;/a&gt; tartamtu (kayata tekstur, &lt;a href="rasa"&gt;rasa&lt;/a&gt;, tampilan) utawa karakteristik kimia jinis &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; tartamtu. Umume, analog daging tegese panganan sing digawe saka bahan-bahan vegetarian, lan kadang-kadang tanpa produk kewan kayata susu. Akeh analog adhedhasar basis &lt;a href="Dhel%C3%A9"&gt;kedele&lt;/a&gt; (kayata &lt;a href="tahu"&gt;tahu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="T%C3%A9mp%C3%A9"&gt;tempe&lt;/a&gt;) utawa basis lem, nanging saiki bisa uga digawe saka protein kacang polong. &lt;a href="Mikoprotein"&gt;Analogi&lt;/a&gt; liyane sing kurang umum kalebu bahan kaya &lt;a href="mikoprotein"&gt;mikoprotein&lt;/a&gt;.
Amarga padha karo daging, mula digunakake ing piring lan praktik panganan sing padha karo &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt;. Pasar target analog daging kalebu &lt;a href="vegetarian"&gt;vegetarian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Veganisme"&gt;vegan&lt;/a&gt;, non-vegetarian sing pengin nyuda &lt;a href="Daging"&gt;konsumsi daginge&lt;/a&gt;, lan wong-wong sing ngetutake &lt;a href="Hukum%20Diet"&gt;hukum panganan&lt;/a&gt; agama ing &lt;a href="Diet%20ing%20agama%20Hindhu"&gt;agama Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kosher"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Halal"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Masakan%20Budha"&gt;Buddha&lt;/a&gt;.
